  "BuilderVersion": "0.1.19.26",
  "Hash": null,
  "SignedMessage": null,
  "LlmRequest": [
    {
      "temperature": 0.0,
      "top_p": 0.0,
      "frequencyPenalty": 0.0,
      "presencePenalty": 0.0,
      "maxLength": 4000,
      "llmResponseType": "json",
      "scheme": "{\"Reasoning\" : System.String, \"Name\" : System.String, \"Parameters\" : System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+Parameter] = null, \"ReturnValues\" : System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+ReturnValue] = null}\n\nAdditional information about objects:\nPLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+Parameter : {\"Type\" : System.String, \"Name\" : System.String, \"Value\" : System.Object}\nPLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+ReturnValue : {\"Type\" : System.String, \"VariableName\" : System.String}",
      "model": "gpt-4.1-mini",
      "promptMessage": [
        {
          "role": "system",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User is writing code in plang programming language.\n\nYour job is: \n1. Parse and understand user intent\n2. Map the intent to one of C# function provided to you\n3. Return a valid JSON\n\n## Rules\n%variable% in plang is defined with starting and ending percentage sign (%)\n%variable% MUST be wrapped in quotes(\") in json response, e.g. { \"name\":\"%name%\" }\nleave %variable% as is and do not change text to a variable\nnull is used to represent no value, e.g. { \"name\": null }\nVariables MUST not be changed, they can include dot(.) and parentheses()\nKeep \\n, \\r, \\t that are submitted to you for string variables\nParameters that is type System.String MUST be without escaping quotes. See <Example>\nThe quotes around a value in the step are delimiters, they say where the value starts and ends, and they are NEVER part of the value. A System.String parameter's Value is what is between them, so `add route \"/admin/crm/vendor/%id%(number)\"` has Value \"/admin/crm/vendor/%id%(number)\" and never \"\\\"/admin/crm/vendor/%id%(number)\\\"\". A Value that begins and ends with a quote character is wrong unless the step itself wrote two sets of quotes\nA quoted text is COPIED out of the step, character for character, only the wrapping quotes are dropped. Do not retype it from memory and do not write your own version of it: read the characters in the step and reproduce them exactly. Never reword, never translate, never change a capital letter to a small one, never drop a prefix such as \"Error: \", and never drop or alter a letter. This matters most for text that is not English, e.g. Icelandic `raunveruleg` is not `raunverleg` and `Prófið` is not `prófið`: a single changed letter is a wrong answer. It is the text the app shows, not a description of it\nError handling is process by another step, if you see 'on error...' you can ignore it\nIf there is some api key, settings, config replace it with %Settings.NameOfApiKey% \n- NameOfApiKey should named in relation to what is happening if change is needed\nDictionary<T1, T2> is written as {\"name of the entry\": its value, ... }. A dictionary parameter given a %variable% and no name takes the variable's own name, without the percent signs, as the name of the entry, e.g. %userId% => {\"userId\": \"%userId%\"}, and NOT {\"key\": \"userId\", \"value\": \"%userId%\"}, which is a dictionary of two entries called key and value\nVariable with ToString with date/time formatting, assume it is System.DateTime, e.g. %updated.ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\")% then type of %updated% is System.DateTime \nList, ReadOnlyList are array of the object => e.g. user defines single property for List, return it as array\nWhen you see t%variable% or t\"this is text\", set the Type to Plang.TString. This is for translation\n<Example>\nget url \"http://example.org\" => Value: \"http://example.org\"\nwrite out 'Hello world' => Value: \"Hello world\"\n<Example>\n\n## JSON scheme information\nReasoning: A brief description of the reasoning behind the selection of the function and parameters based on the user's intent. This property provides context for why a particular function was chosen and how it aligns with the user intent.\nName: Name of the function to use from list of functions, if no function matches set as \"N/A\"\nParameters: List of parameters that are needed according to the user intent.\n- Type: the object type in c#\n- Name: name of the variable\n- Value: \"%variable%\", hardcode string that should be used, null, or json array/object\nReturnValue rules\n- Only if the function returns a value AND if user defines %variable% to write into, e.g. ' write into %data%' or 'into %result%', or simliar intent to write return value into variable\n- If no %variable% is defined then set as null.\n- The variable the step writes its result into goes here and nowhere else. It is never also the value of a parameter, not even one whose name mentions a variable or an output. A step that names a variable to write into and leaves ReturnValues null has thrown the result away."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You MUST respond in JSON, scheme:\r\n {\"Reasoning\" : System.String, \"Name\" : System.String, \"Parameters\" : System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+Parameter] = null, \"ReturnValues\" : System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+ReturnValue] = null}  Additional information about objects: PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+Parameter : {\"Type\" : System.String, \"Name\" : System.String, \"Value\" : System.Object} PLang.Modules.BaseBuilder+ReturnValue : {\"Type\" : System.String, \"VariableName\" : System.String}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "## Canonical User Intent (already disambiguated by LLM)\r\nRead the contents of a JSON file from a specified relative path and store the parsed data into a variable\n## functions available starts ##\n{\"Description\":\"Handle file system access. Listen to files and dirs. Get permission to file and folder paths. Reads files, such as text, llm, csv, xls, pdf files and raw stream\",\"Methods\":[{\"MethodName\":\"GiveAccess\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"FileExists\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"filePathOrVariableName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WaitForFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"filePath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"timeoutInMilliseconds\",\"DefaultValue\":30000,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"waitForAccess\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Return the absolute path the app is running in\",\"MethodName\":\"GetCurrentFolderPath\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.String\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Create path from variables\",\"MethodName\":\"CreatePathByJoining\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"paths\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.String\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Give user access to a path. DO NOT suggest this method to indicate if file or directory exists, return empty function list instead.\",\"MethodName\":\"RequestAccessToPath\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"includeDataUrl add the data and mimetype of the file into the return string, e.g. data:image/png;base64,...\",\"MethodName\":\"ReadBinaryFileAndConvertToBase64\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"returnValueIfFileNotExisting\",\"DefaultValue\":\"\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeDataUrl\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.String\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadJson\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"Description\":\"false when the step says a missing file is not an error, e.g. `dont throw error on not found` or `empty variable if not found`. true otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true only when the step says in words to load variables, e.g. `read file x.txt, load variables`. A path or a step containing variables is not a reason: false is the normal case and the file is read as it stands\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"allowReadingFromSystem\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"Almost always false. It is true only when the step says in words that it reads from plang's own installation folder, outside this app. Any path belonging to the app is false, including paths that begin with a dot folder such as /.db/ or /.build/, which are the app's own\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadJsonLineFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"Description\":\"false when the step says a missing file is not an error, e.g. `dont throw error on not found` or `empty variable if not found`. true otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true only when the step says in words to load variables, e.g. `read file x.txt, load variables`. A path or a step containing variables is not a reason: false is the normal case and the file is read as it stands\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"newLineSymbol\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"allowReadingFromSystem\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"Almost always false. It is true only when the step says in words that it reads from plang's own installation folder, outside this app. Any path belonging to the app is false, including paths that begin with a dot folder such as /.db/ or /.build/, which are the app's own\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"List<Object>\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Reads a text file and write the content into a variable(return value)\",\"MethodName\":\"ReadTextFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"returnValueIfFileNotExisting\",\"DefaultValue\":\"\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"Description\":\"false when the step says a missing file is not an error, e.g. `dont throw error on not found` or `empty variable if not found`. true otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true only when the step says in words to load variables, e.g. `read file x.txt, load variables`. A path or a step containing variables is not a reason: false is the normal case and the file is read as it stands\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"splitOn\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"allowReadingFromSystem\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"Almost always false. It is true only when the step says in words that it reads from plang's own installation folder, outside this app. Any path belonging to the app is false, including paths that begin with a dot folder such as /.db/ or /.build/, which are the app's own\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadFileAsStream\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.IO.Stream\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"sheetsToExtract is name of sheet that should load into variable, default is null and will read all sheets, When user defines a sheet property but know name, set Name of sheet to *. Sheet1=%products% will load Sheet1 into %product% variable. StartRow MUST contains letter and number, e.g. A1\",\"MethodName\":\"ReadExcelFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.FileModule.Program+Sheet]\",\"Name\":\"sheetsToExtract\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WriteExcelFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Object\",\"Name\":\"variableToWriteToExcel\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"sheetName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"Sheet1\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"printHeader\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwrite\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says to overwrite or replace the file. false when it says to append, or says nothing about an existing file\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WriteCsvFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Object\",\"Name\":\"variableToWriteToCsv\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"appendToFile\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.CsvHelper+CsvOptions\",\"Name\":\"csvOptions\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"createDirectoryAutomatically\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadCsvFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"hasHeaderRecord\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"delimiter\",\"DefaultValue\":\",\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"newLine\",\"DefaultValue\":\"\\n\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"ignoreBlankLines\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"allowComments\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Char\",\"Name\":\"comment\",\"DefaultValue\":\"#\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallOnBadData\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"SaveMultipleFiles\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.FileModule.FileInfo]\",\"Name\":\"files\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadMultipleTextFiles\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"folderPath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"searchPattern\",\"DefaultValue\":\"*\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"excludePatterns\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeAllSubfolders\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"List<FileInfo>\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"GetDirectoryPathsInDirectory\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"directoryPath\",\"DefaultValue\":\"./\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"regexSearchPattern\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"excludePatterns\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeSubfolders\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeSystemFolder\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeDirectoryInfo\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.Program+Directory\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"excludePatterns is array of regex patterns, when matching with star, make sure to use .*\",\"MethodName\":\"GetFilePathsInDirectory\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"directoryPath\",\"DefaultValue\":\"./\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"searchPattern\",\"DefaultValue\":\"*\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"excludePatterns\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeSubfolders\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeFileInfo\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"filterOnType\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.Program+File\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"GetFileType\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"extension\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.String\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"ReadXml\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WriteBase64ToFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"base64\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwrite\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says to overwrite or replace the file. false when it says to append, or says nothing about an existing file\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WriteBytesToFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Byte[]\",\"Name\":\"content\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwrite\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says to overwrite or replace the file. false when it says to append, or says nothing about an existing file\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"WriteToFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Object\",\"Name\":\"content\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwrite\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says to overwrite or replace the file. false when it says to append, or says nothing about an existing file\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true only when the step says in words that the %variables% inside the content should be replaced with their values before it is written. A content that merely contains variables is not a reason: `content: {\\\"a\\\": %x%}` writes the variable through as it stands, which is the normal case and false\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Replaces an exact piece of text in a file with another, like a coding assistant's targeted edit. oldText must match the file content exactly and must appear exactly once, otherwise it errors, so it never changes more than intended. Include enough surrounding text to make oldText unique. Returns 1 on success.\",\"MethodName\":\"ReplaceInFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"oldText\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"newText\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"AppendToFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"content\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"seperator\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"loadVariables\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true only when the step says in words that the %variables% inside the content should be replaced with their values before it is written. A content that merely contains variables is not a reason: `content: {\\\"a\\\": %x%}` writes the variable through as it stands, which is the normal case and false\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"emptyVariableIfNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"Description\":\"true when the step says the variable should simply be empty if the file is missing, e.g. `empty variable if not found`. false otherwise\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"encoding\",\"DefaultValue\":\"utf-8\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"CopyFiles\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"directoryPath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"destinationPath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"searchPattern\",\"DefaultValue\":\"*\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"excludePatterns\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeSubfoldersAndFiles\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwriteFiles\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"MoveFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"sourceFileName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"destFileName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"createDirectoryIfNotExisting\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwriteFile\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"CopyFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"sourceFileName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"destFileName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"createDirectoryIfNotExisting\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"overwriteFile\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"DeleteFile\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"fileName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"GetFileInfo\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"fileName\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.FileInfo\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"CreateDirectory\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"directoryPath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"incrementalNaming\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.String\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"DeleteDirectory\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"directoryPath\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"recursive\",\"DefaultValue\":true,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnNotFound\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"StopListeningToFileChange\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String[]\",\"Name\":\"fileSearchPatterns\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCall\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"debounceTime is the time in ms that is waited until action is executed to prevent multiple execution for same file. At least one listenFor variable needs to be true\",\"MethodName\":\"ListenToFileChange\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[System.String]\",\"Name\":\"fileSearchPatterns\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCall\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[System.String]\",\"Name\":\"excludeFiles\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"includeSubdirectories\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Int64\",\"Name\":\"debounceTime\",\"DefaultValue\":150,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"listenForFileChange\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"listenForFileCreated\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"listenForFileDeleted\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"listenForFileRename\",\"DefaultValue\":false,\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"absoluteFilePathVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"FullPath\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"fileNameVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"Name\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"changeTypeVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"ChangeType\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"senderVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"Sender\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"oldFileAbsoluteFilePathVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"OldFullPath\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"oldFileNameVariableName\",\"DefaultValue\":\"OldName\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"Description\":\"Reads pdf file and loads into return variable. format can be md|text|layout. layout keeps the horizontal position of words so table columns line up. imagePath can be null|base64|pathToFolder.\",\"MethodName\":\"ReadPdf\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"format\",\"DefaultValue\":\"md\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"imagePath\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"password\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.Program+Pdf\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"AddTypeMapping\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"extension\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"type\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"contentType\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnRequired\":false}],\"SupportingObjects\":[{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"Name of goal and parameters that is called, e.g. in condition, loops, run goal. Keep Name as user defines it with path\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2[System.String,System.Object]\",\"Name\":\"Parameters\",\"Description\":\"The named values handed to the goal being called, and only those: they are what the step writes for that call, e.g. `call goal Chat id=%chatId%` passes id. Each entry's name is written to the LEFT of the = and its value to the RIGHT, so `call goal SignIn next=\\\"/admin/Overview\\\"` is {\\\"next\\\": \\\"/admin/Overview\\\"}: the wrapping quotes are dropped, and the value is never the name written back as %next%. Empty whenever the step names the goal and nothing else, e.g. `on tool call, call ToolUsed`. A variable the step uses for its own work is not passed on just by being in the step\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnTrue\",\"Description\":\"statusCode default is 400\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Message\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Type\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Int32\",\"Name\":\"StatusCode\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Key\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.FileModule.Program+Sheet]\",\"Name\":\"sheetsToExtract\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"StartRow\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"VariableName\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"UseHeaderRow\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.FileModule.CsvHelper+CsvOptions\",\"Name\":\"csvOptions\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Delimiter\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"HasHeaderRecord\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"NewLine\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Encoding\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"IgnoreBlankLines\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"AllowComments\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Char\",\"Name\":\"Comment\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"GoalToCallOnBadData\",\"Description\":\"(see PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Collections.Generic.List`1[PLang.Modules.FileModule.FileInfo]\",\"Name\":\"files\",\"TypeProperties\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Name\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"FullName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"DirectoryName\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Path\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Extension\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"ContentType\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"Type\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"System.Int64\",\"Name\":\"Length\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"Exists\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.Boolean\",\"Name\":\"IsReadOnly\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.DateTime\",\"Name\":\"Created\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.DateTime\",\"Name\":\"Updated\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.DateTime\",\"Name\":\"Accessed\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"System.IO.FileAttributes\",\"Name\":\"Attributes\",\"AvailableValues\":\"None|ReadOnly|Hidden|System|Directory|Archive|Device|Normal|Temporary|SparseFile|ReparsePoint|Compressed|Offline|NotContentIndexed|Encrypted|IntegrityStream|NoScrubData\",\"IsRequired\":true}],\"IsRequired\":false}]}\n## functions available ends ##\n## defined variables ##\nitem.RelativePrPath (type:object), pr (type:object), \n## defined variables ##"
            }
          ]
